#35401
Peaceful grotto.~
As you enter this subterranean cavern you notice an eerie candescence from
myriad tiny pearly shells , bright colored anenome wave their tentacles towards
you.  Seaweeds of different shades of green, caress your legs as they sway
gently in the current.    
