#35492
Umberlee's Throne room.~
Umberlee's throne room is a daunting place indeed, swirling pools on the walls
show moving pictures of ships on the ocean's surface. Some sinking, some sailing 
merrily. As you stand in awe, you realize they are not pictures but views to
other parts to the realms. As you stand awestruck you see Umberlee gesture
and the mighty kraken crushes the hull of a passing ship dooming its sailors to death.
~
